### ==============================================================================
### AGRIMAN INVENTORY MANAGEMENT HTTP TEST SUITE (Part 2 - Kalyan kumar vanumu)
### Stock Movements Engine: Live Directory, Stock In, Stock Out, Stock Transfer
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5147
@contentType = application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. LIVE STOCK DIRECTORY (Missing Read APIs)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 1.1 GET Live Stock Directory with Pagination, Search & Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory?search=fertilizer&categoryId=1&location=Main%20Warehouse&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 1.2 GET Stock Breakdown across all Storage Locations for a Product
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/1/stock
Accept: {{contentType}}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. STOCK IN (GET & POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 2.1 GET Stock In History (with date, product, location, and supplier filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-in?productId=1&location=Main%20Warehouse&supplierId=5&fromDate=2026-01-01&toDate=2026-12-31&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 2.2 POST Stock In - Valid Incoming Delivery (Auto-generates SIN-YYYY-NNN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-in
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 50.0,
  "unitPrice": 1450.00,
  "supplierId": 5,
  "supplierName": "Sri Rama Agro Chemicals",
  "referenceType": "Purchase",
  "notes": "50 bags of Urea received in prime condition"
}

### 2.3 POST Stock In - Validation Test (Non-existent Product ID returns 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-in
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 999999,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 10.0,
  "unitPrice": 500.00,
  "notes": "Should return 404 Not Found"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. STOCK OUT (GET & POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 3.1 GET Stock Out History (with date, product, location, farm/crop filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-out?productId=1&location=Main%20Warehouse&farmId=2&cropId=1&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 3.2 POST Stock Out - Valid Issue to Field (Auto-generates SOUT-YYYY-NNN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-out
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 15.0,
  "farmId": 2,
  "cropId": 1,
  "issuedTo": "Ramesh (Tractor Operator)",
  "purpose": "First Basal Dressing for Cotton Season",
  "referenceType": "FieldUsage",
  "notes": "Applied across 5 acres"
}

### 3.3 POST Stock Out - Strict Insufficient Stock Test (Returns 400 Bad Request)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-out
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "storageLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 999999.0,
  "farmId": 2,
  "cropId": 1,
  "issuedTo": "Test Operator",
  "purpose": "Excessive request test",
  "notes": "Should trigger strict insufficient-stock validation error"
}


### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. STOCK TRANSFER (GET & POST)
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### 4.1 GET Stock Transfer History
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-transfer?productId=1&fromLocation=Main%20Warehouse&toLocation=North%20Farm%20Shed&page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: {{contentType}}

### 4.2 POST Stock Transfer - Valid Transfer (Generates Paired STR-OUT & STR-IN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-transfer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "toLocation": "North Farm Shed",
  "quantity": 10.0,
  "notes": "Dispatched for urgent spraying in North Field"
}

### 4.3 POST Stock Transfer - Validation Test: Identical Locations (Returns 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/Inventory/stock-transfer
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "productId": 1,
  "fromLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "toLocation": "Main Warehouse",
  "quantity": 5.0,
  "notes": "Should return 400 Bad Request: Locations cannot be identical"
}
